            <div xml:id="d578">

                <pb facs="1060" n="1038" sameAs="frus:frus1950v05/pg1038"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Secretary’s Memoranda, Lot 53 D 444</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Special
                            Assistant to the Secretary of State</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Battle</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1950-10-26">October 26, 1950</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">Item 6. <hi rendition="#italic">Israeli Loan Application</hi>
                </p>
                <p>The Secretary told me after his appointment with the President today, that he had
                    discussed the Israeli loan application with him, and that the President had
                    indicated he would look into the matter and speak to the Secretary again. The
                    Secretary said that meanwhile he would discuss this matter with Mr. Webb.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>L[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ucius</hi>] D. B[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">attle</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
